#. <CLT 4>まずは、さっき配られたモノクマファイルに
#. 目を通しておこう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess I should look through the Monokuma File we got\n"
"before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>被害者は舞園さやか…
#. 死亡時刻は午前１時半頃。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The victim was Sayaka Maizono. The time of death is\n"
"estimated to be around 1:30 a.m.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体発見現場となったのは、
#. 寄宿舎エリアにある苗木誠の個室。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The body was discovered in Makoto's room, in the\n"
"dormitory.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>被害者はそのシャワールームで死亡していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"All evidence suggests that the death took place in\n"
"the bathroom.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>致命傷は刃物で刺された腹部の傷。
#. その他、右手首に打撃痕あり。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The cause of death was a stab wound to the abdomen.\n"
"There was also an injury to her right wrist.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>打撃痕のある右手首は、骨折している模様。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"Specifically, the wrist appears to have suffered a\n"
"fracture.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これを元に…
#. 捜査を進めていくしかないのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We have no choice but to push forward if we want to\n"
"find out what happened...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんとかして…突き止めないと…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Somehow, I have to find out the truth."
msgstr ""

#. ボクやみんなが生き残る為に…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So that we can all survive..."
msgstr ""

#. そして、舞園さんの為にも…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And for Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. 絶対に、舞園さんが殺された理由を
#. 突き止めるんだ！！
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I have to find out how she was killed!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>モノクマファイル１<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma File #1<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲さんは、捜査に行かないの？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Aren't you going to help investigate, Chihiro?"
msgstr ""

#. でも…江ノ島さんを置いて行ったら…
#. か、可哀相だから…
msgctxt "0014 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"But...I can't leave Junko here. I-I feel sorry for\n"
"her..."
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に…いてあげないと……
msgctxt "0015 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I...I have to stay with her."
msgstr ""

#. うう…イヤだ……
#. リアルな話…こんな場所で死にたくねーって…
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ugh...no way. I seriously don't wanna die here...!"
msgstr ""

#. お願いッ！　助けてください、
#. 神様仏様女神様宇宙神様界王神様！
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'm begging you! God, Buddha, Mother Earth, God of\n"
"Space, King Neptune! Help me!"
msgstr ""

#. 誰でもいいから助けてください～！！
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I don't care who it is, just get me outta here!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンは…捜査どころじゃなさそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro doesn't seem prepared to do any kind of\n"
"investigating right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだ！　このモノクマが写るモニター！
#. ここに事件の手がかりが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's it! The monitor Monokuma always shows up on!\n"
"There's gotta be a clue here!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ある訳ない。捜査に集中しよう。
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Or not. I'd better get back to the investigation."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…ボクらを監視して…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Someone's spying on us with that camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰が…どんな目的で…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But who is it? And what for!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、江ノ島さんの死体にそっと手を触れてみた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I gently placed my hand on Junko's lifeless body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>映画やドラマで見るように、
#. 彼女の手や首の脈を確かめてみたのだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I touched her wrist to check for a pulse, like they do\n"
"in movies and stuff, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 本当に…死んでる……
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She...really is dead."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それ以上は一切の言い表しようもないほど…
#. 彼女は完全に死んでいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There wasn't anything else to say. She was gone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. クソッ…！
#. なんで…こんな事に…！
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Dammit...! Why is this happening!?"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0030 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0031 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>体育館から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the gym?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
